  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A flying mob: mode fly gives it flying movement and navigation, it hovers in place when idle (hovers true) and takes no fall damage; flying_speed sets how fast it flies. It never fights: it only wanders and looks about. The roost goal makes it hang upside down under a block through the day, as a bat, letting go when a player comes within 8 blocks. It spawns in every mountain biome in groups of one to three. msm:animated_model names the model, animation set and texture with renderer auto: GeckoLib draws it where the target has GeckoLib, the runtime's own renderer elsewhere. Export the Fabric mod jar to try it in game.",
